			"Message": "chore(Project): Update submodules and enhance cross-platform infrastructure\n\nThis commit synchronizes critical submodules and refines Land's cross-platform architecture:\n\n1. **Dependency Update** advances the Microsoft/VSCode submodule to upstream commit 657c868e, incorporating 24 changes including extension host stability fixes and API updates. This ensures compatibility with the latest VS Code platform developments while preserving Land's custom patches.\n\n2. **Element Submodule** updates (1a335cde) include:\n   - Mountain's Apple platform support enhancements (asset catalogs, Metal integration, Xcode project)\n   - SideCar runtime cleanup removing .DS_Store artifacts\n   - Dependency updates across Effect-TS, GitHub Actions, and Node.js binaries\n   - Debug.sh script consistency improvements\n\nAll changes maintain strict separation between Mountain's native backend and Wind/Sky's declarative UI layer, while advancing Land's architectural goals of resource efficiency and cross-platform compatibility.\n\nRefs #106 #186 #344 #346 #320 #161",
			"SHA": "8a902c5636da782b23cd7204ee42b671143d734b"
